# The API image build context: global.json, everything under backend except tests and build output, and the
# embedded game-rule catalogs. A path under an excluded parent cannot be re-included, so docs is reopened level by
# level instead of naming docs/game-rules/catalogs directly. No HEALTHCHECK: the image has no curl, and Container
# Apps probes /health itself.
*
!global.json
!backend/
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/game-rules/
!docs/game-rules/catalogs/
!docs/game-rules/catalogs/*
**/bin/
**/obj/
backend/tests/
backend/src/CocAssistant.Api/App_Data/
